render: skip the XYB conversion in convert_color_for_record when the color transform cannot be built
or run, instead of unwrapping the error (util.rs: called `Result::unwrap()` on an `Err` value:
UnsupportedColorEncoding). Test: xyb_transform_soft_fail
(crates/jxl-oxide-tests/tests/xyb_transform_soft_fail.rs).

Upstream: not reported; the code is unchanged at upstream HEAD (c0cc4c7, 2026-08-15).

